.TH FCHDIR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fchdir \- change the working directory using a descriptor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int fchdir(int descriptor);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes the process's current working directory to the open directory.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chdir (3crunch),
.BR fchdir (2)
